      "id": "text_12_3615",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Socket.io - real-time chat transport\nLiveKit - voice calls\nRedis (TTL keys + socket events) - presence\nRedis (delayed events) - typing indicators\nBullMQ + Redis + Web Push - offline notifications\n@socket.io/redis-adapter - pub/sub backplane\n  for scaling chat server horizontally",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Socket.io - real-time chat transport\nLiveKit - voice calls\nRedis (TTL keys + socket events) - presence\nRedis (delayed events) - typing indicators\nBullMQ + Redis + Web Push - offline notifications\n@socket.io/redis-adapter - pub/sub backplane\n  for scaling chat server horizontally",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
