      "id": "text_73_8962",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Recent chats     TTL 2 days (max 200)\nMember status    TTL 2 min\nTyping status    TTL 5 sec\nSeenBy cache     TTL 2 days\n\n[*] also used as Socket.io Redis\nAdapter pub/sub backplane for\nhorizontal scaling",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
